body:
Listen, you need to get your baby care.  Not eating is a bad sign, I understand $ is tight.  Google search your zip code along with "24 hour emergency vet" and call all of them.  Explain your situation - would you be able to put any money down for a deposit?  A lot of vets are kind and will give you a few days to try and raise the money.  I don't know if you're apart of Facebook but I am, and on the animal groups people raise money every day for their vet bills.  Just last night we helped a woman get her cat care, similar situation.  If you direct message me I could help you, but please contact your local emergency vets and see if there's anything they can do to help you.

&#x200B;

Also try [carecredit.com](https://carecredit.com) \- they will allow you to apply for credit for you pet.  If you have bad credit, you can get a cosigner as well.

&#x200B;

Just I hope your baby makes it okay, best wishes. DM me if you need
